# Hi 👋, I'm Tavakalmastan

## 🚀 ASIC Physical Design | RTL-to-GDSII | STA | CTS | P&R | Timing Closure

I am an **Electronics & Communication Engineering graduate** focused on **ASIC Physical Design and Backend VLSI**, with hands-on experience in **RTL-to-GDSII implementation** using **Cadence Genus and Innovus**.

I have hands-on experience in **Synthesis, Floorplanning, Macro Placement, Power Planning, Placement, Clock Tree Synthesis (CTS), Routing, Static Timing Analysis (STA), Timing Closure, DRC Debugging, and QoR Optimization**.

I have worked on ASIC designs using a **45nm technology node** and am currently undergoing **advanced ASIC Physical Design training**, strengthening my expertise in physical implementation, STA, timing closure, and design optimization.

